.env.local
# mise's local override file. It is where the Langfuse and gateway credentials
# belong on a developer's machine, which is exactly why it must never be
# committed. mise merges it automatically on top of .mise.toml.
.mise.local.toml
.mise.*.local.toml

# jqwik writes this after every run of the property tests, and an untracked
# file here is not cosmetic: `ai4dev module N start` refuses to move when
# `git status --porcelain` is not empty, so one test run would block the next
# module for everybody.
.jqwik-database
